    h1 Select-Only Combobox Example @86,102,625,25
    h2 Read This First @86,139,625,21
    card @86,172,625,71
      text The code in this example is not intended for production environments. Before using it for any purpose, read this to understand why. warning @103,187,591,41
    h2 About This Example @86,255,625,21
    text The following example implementation of the demonstrates a single-select combobox widget that is functionally similar to an HTML element. Unlike the editable combobox examples, this select-only combobox is not made with an element, and it does not accept freeform user input. However, like an HTML , users can type characters to select matching options. @86,288,625,81
    link "Combobox Pattern" ../../ @86,381,625,21
    text select primary @86,414,625,20
    text <input> primary @86,446,625,20
    text <select> primary @86,478,625,20
    text Similar examples include: @86,510,625,21
    text : An editable combobox that demonstrates the autocomplete behavior known as . @86,543,625,20
    link "Editable Combobox with Both List and Inline Autocomplete" ../combobox-autocomplete-both/ @86,575,625,20
    text list with inline autocomplete @86,607,625,21
    text : An editable combobox that demonstrates the autocomplete behavior known as . @86,640,625,20
    link "Editable Combobox with List Autocomplete" ../combobox-autocomplete-list/ @86,672,625,20
    text list with manual selection @86,704,625,20
    text : An editable combobox that demonstrates the behavior associated with . @86,736,625,21
    link "Editable Combobox Without Autocomplete" ../combobox-autocomplete-none/ @86,769,625,20
    text primary @86,801,625,20
    text : An editable combobox that presents suggestions in a grid, enabling users to navigate descriptive information about each suggestion. @86,833,625,41
    link "Editable Combobox with Grid Popup" ../grid-combo/ @86,886,625,20
    text : An editable date input combobox that opens a dialog containing a calendar grid and buttons for navigating by month and year. @86,918,625,41
    link "Date Picker Combobox" ../combobox-datepicker/ @86,971,625,20
